  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In the new beta UI, Public worlds shown on your profile appear to be ordered randomly or at least in a manner that isnt very useful. With the addition of profile customization it would be nice to allow customizing the order for how different world lists show up on your profile. For example in edit profile you might be able to choose by what data they are sorted [Alphabetically, Newest first, Oldest first, most visits, most favourited, etc.] additionally or alternatively you might be able to select featured worlds from the list like you can currently do with badges instead of having them automatically sorted.",
